    "body": "I ran into a performance issue when queueing microtasks a lot in the case that there are no selectedcontent elements to update. I fixed this by [avoiding queueing the microtask](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/57b0f75a6911706a7755d61254f5a04eccc1e5f2) when there are no descendant selectedcontent elements to update in [this PR](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12263), which was [then removed](https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/77bf023b8b6d7a2727741d93f0dce16b4e588010) before we merged that PR.\n\nDo you think we could re-add that condition here? It would be hard to observe the difference but I think could be worth including.",
