    "body": "The new selectedcontent-pending-update flag is not ideal imo since select elements also have a flag to say that they are going to be updated, and the one on select elements is used in the vast majority of cases but this selectedcontent one is only used in an edge case for move steps, if I'm reading this PR correctly. Is that true? If you feel confident that we should still have this flag, should there be a note or something below that explains that this selectedcontent-pending-update flag is only used for an edge case with move steps and that the flag on select elements is used in the vast majority of cases instead?",
